+"""
+Attestation verification service with vendor hooks for TPM/SGX/Nitro (productionized).
+ - Verifies attestation reports with vendor flows (TPM2-tools, Intel DCAP/Quote Verification, AWS Nitro)
+ - Issues Vault PKI certs programmatically via hvac (no shell calls)
